    {"counterbore_hole_bridging", "coEnum", "Bridge counterbore holes", "", "", "This option creates bridges for counterbore holes, allowing them to be printed without support. Available modes include:\n1. None: No bridge is created\n2. Partially Bridged: Only a part of the unsupported area will be bridged\n3. Sacrificial Layer: A full sacrificial bridge layer is created", "Quality", "advanced", "none\npartiallybridge\nsacrificiallayer", "None\nPartially bridged\nSacrificial layer", "", ""},
